{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《悠長假期》製作特輯陸續釋出不少拍攝花絮，男主角Edan呂爵安在劇中關鍵鋼琴比賽場口要求極高現場收音標準，被視 …</p><p></p>\n<p>《悠長假期》製作特輯陸續釋出不少拍攝花絮，男主角Edan呂爵安在劇中關鍵鋼琴比賽場口要求極高現場收音標準，被視為全劇亮點兼極具難度的致敬戲份，Edan更剖白真實感受。</p>\n<h2>Edan拍攝《悠長假期》現場緊張到腳震</h2>\n<p>劇組日前公開最新製作特輯，曝光多個鋼琴高手雲集及嚴陣以待拍攝彈琴場口的畫面。由於Edan日常拍攝行程非常緊湊，他只能犧牲個人休息時間，每日爭取在放飯空檔瘋狂練習琴技。面對現場收音要求極其嚴格，加上長時間缺乏充足休息，他在正式埋位拍攝彈琴戲份時承受著超乎想像的心理壓力，甚至在鏡頭前出現緊張到雙腳不停震動的真實生理反應。</p>\n<h2>Edan手寫樂譜頂硬上堅持重拍多次</h2>\n<p>為了應付初賽情節中1首原著根本沒有現成樂譜的曲目，劇組只能依靠工作人員反覆聆聽錄音並以人手重新編寫記譜，大幅增加現場演繹難度。Edan在受訪時直認彈奏該樂譜時壓力爆煲，他親自解畫：「有時緊張彈錯，嗰日每首都重拍4、5次，有少少瑕疵都想做好佢。」即使身體極度疲勞，每首曲目最終均經歷4至5次重拍才正式完成。</p>\n<h2>致敬《悠長假期》煞科翌日即時病倒</h2>\n<p>這次劇組為求向日本經典原版神劇致敬，不惜花費大量人力物力重新處理鋼琴比賽細節。Edan在毫無退路及極端高壓環境下捱過這段艱難時期，更在鏡頭前強忍身心不適直到最後1刻。當全劇組終於宣告順利煞科，一直處於緊繃狀態的他隨即在翌日不支倒地並宣告病倒，他坦言：「去到一拍完就即刻病，可能放下咗心頭大石。」</p>\n<h2>網民高度期待經典重現</h2>\n<p>相關製作特輯在各大社交平台發布後迅速掀起熱烈討論，不少觀眾對製作團隊展現出的誠意表示讚賞。大批粉絲亦被Edan堅毅不屈及專業態度吸引，紛紛湧入留言區為他打氣，直指「有Edan彈琴嘅片段，感覺唔同晒，期待港版《悠長假期》嘅播出」，同時也有大批網民留言讚歎「Edan琴技好勁呀」。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794930084115629_12548153066afc75a47989e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794930084115629_12548153066afc75a47989e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>劇組日前公開最新製作特輯，曝光多個鋼琴高手雲集及嚴陣以待拍攝彈琴場口的畫面。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179493008577016841_1836330646afc75a646a7d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179493008577016841_1836330646afc75a646a7d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Edan在受訪時直認彈奏該樂譜時壓力爆煲。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949300867869058_8901289736afc75a742de8.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-5\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949300867869058_8901289736afc75a742de8.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>這次劇組為求向日本經典原版神劇致敬，不惜花費大量人力物力重新處理鋼琴比賽細節。（圖片來源：《悠長假期》）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949300959453079_3495576356afc75b06a897.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949300959453079_3495576356afc75b06a897.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>由於Edan日常拍攝行程非常緊湊，他只能犧牲個人休息時間，每日爭取在放飯空檔瘋狂練習琴技。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949300980308619_7134067506afc75b2d76bf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949300980308619_7134067506afc75b2d76bf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179493010010426681_10793182306afc75b4a1e3c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-2\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179493010010426681_10793182306afc75b4a1e3c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/edan/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Edan</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%91%82%e7%88%b5%e5%ae%89/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">呂爵安</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%82%a0%e9%95%b7%e5%81%87%e6%9c%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">悠長假期</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%8b%bc%e7%90%b4%e6%af%94%e8%b3%bd/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鋼琴比賽</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3544991\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 17 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T16:57:47.259025+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1347,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T15:41:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T18:32:28.278184+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T16:51:03.969269+00:00","content_hash":"a09308474510fd89745669078c54458b5ee907b9aea938afe1c3f439e2a87f70","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}